OL,3,ADelhi air quality worsens ahead of
OL,4,ADiwali as firework restrictions enter
OL,5,Aforce
OL,6,
OL,7,FDelhi is once again battling worsening
OL,8,Fair pollution as the onset of winter
OL,9,Fbrings a familiar deterioration in air
OL,10,Fquality to India's capital.
OL,12,FThe city's air quality index (AQI) -
OL,13,Fwhich measures PM2.5, fine particulate
OL,14,Fmatter that can clog lungs - has
OL,15,Fcrossed 300, entering the "very poor"
OL,16,Fcategory and raising health concerns
OL,17,Ffor millions of residents.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
