OL,3,ADelhi air quality worsens ahead of
OL,4,ADiwali as firework restrictions enter
OL,5,Aforce
OL,6,
OL,7,FBreathing such polluted air over
OL,8,Fprolonged periods can cause respiratory
OL,9,Fproblems and worsen existing illnesses,
OL,10,Fwith children and older people
OL,11,Fparticularly vulnerable.
OL,13,FAuthorities have responded by invoking
OL,14,FStage II of the Graded Response Action
OL,15,FPlan (GRAP), introducing measures to
OL,16,Fcurb dust, vehicle emissions and other
OL,17,Fsources of pollution.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
